msgctxt "92"
msgid "Hey, buddy, you ever make your way over to the Canal Grande?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "No..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"You owe it to yourself to check it out! They've got the sexiest girls this "
"side of the Arakawa, and, boy, do they know how to work a pole! Lemme tell "
"ya!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "You mean pole dancing, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"Yeah. They even have this two-tiered stage in addition to a huge main "
"stage. It's unlike anything you've ever seen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"Lotta customers pay them a visit whenever they find themselves in Okinawa. "
"It's just down there at the end of the street!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "(<Color:7>Canal Grande<Color:Default>, huh...? Maybe Toma will be there.)"
msgstr ""

